      <description><![CDATA[
            <div class="content-box" id="content">
                <style>     div[type]{-webkit-border-radius: 4pt; border-radius: 4pt;overflow:hidden;}     div[type] img{ -webkit-border-radius: 4pt;border-radius: 4pt;}     p{font-family:'苹方','PingFang','\82f95b9','微软雅黑','Microsoft YaHei','XinGothic-SinaWeibo', helvetica, arial, sans-serif;} 	.initFade{ 	    -webkit-transition:opacity 1s; 	    -o-transition:opacity 1s; 	    transition:opacity 1s; 		opacity:0; 	}     .jijin{margin-top: 1.222em !important;padding-bottom: 0.333em;}.jijin_img{display: block;}h3+p{line-height: 12px !important;padding: 4px !important;margin: 0 !important;overflow: visible;}h3+p span{height: 1.72em;line-height: 1.72em;top: 0;}style+p{margin-top: 1.139em;}style+div[type*='GIF'],style+div[type*='IMG']{margin-top: 1.222em !important;}div + div[type*='GIF'], div + div[type*='IMG']{margin-top: 1.778em !important;}div[type*='GIF']{margin: -0.111em auto 0 !important;} div[type*='IMG']{margin: -0.111em auto 0 !important;} body,p{text-align: justify;line-height: 1.72em !important;} p{word-wrap: break-word;overflow:hidden;max-width:100%;word-break: normal !important;margin: 1.44em 0;}.img-info{font-size:0.8333em;line-height:1.53333em!important;text-align:left;color:#999;margin:1.0666em 0 -0.29833em;}   .sub-tlt{position:relative;font-weight: bold;text-indent:0.7777em;}   .sub-tlt:before{content:"";position:absolute;left:0;top:0.86em;width:0.333em;height:0.333em;background:#333;-webkit-transform:translateY(-50%);transform:translateY(-50%)}.img-info + div[type*='GIF'],.img-info + div[type*='IMG']{margin: 1.777em auto 0 !important;}</style><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.8" data="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260429/202604290255372755.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.8" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.8" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260429/202604290255372755_720.jpg" alt="" src="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260429/202604290255372755_720.jpg"> </div><p><strong>【战报新闻】</strong></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-04-29/match1944213date2026vnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">进球大战！巴黎5-4拜仁占先机 K77、登贝莱双响凯恩奥利塞建功</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.66" data="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260429/zhanbao_image_1944213_1777409109_gray.jpeg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.66" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.66" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260429/zhanbao_image_1944213_1777409109_gray.jpeg" alt="" src="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260429/zhanbao_image_1944213_1777409109_gray.jpeg"> </div><p>登贝莱、克瓦拉茨赫利亚均双响，凯恩、奥利塞、迪亚斯破门。最终巴黎5-4拜仁占得先机，双方次回合将于5月7日凌晨3点移师拜仁主场。</p><p><strong>【比赛相关】</strong></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-04-29/69f124ee89db1native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">看你们了！巴黎拜仁神仙局合轰9球，阿森纳vs马竞明晨03：00开打</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.9" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260429/202604290522009865_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.9" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.9" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260429/202604290522009865_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260429/202604290522009865_720.jpg"> </div><p>欧冠半决赛首回合，巴黎与拜仁打出了一场5-4的神仙比赛，明天凌晨阿森纳将对阵马竞。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-04-29/69f112dbe9302native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">官方解释阿方索点球：球员手臂处于非自然位置且远离躯干</a></p><p>欧冠半决赛巴黎对阵拜仁，半场补时阶段阿方索禁区内手球，VAR介入介入后判罚点球，官网给出了判罚解释。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-04-29/69f11afca2186native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">杀疯了！巴黎5-4拜仁双方共打进9球，刷新欧冠半决赛单场进球纪录</a></p><p style="text-align: center;"></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.8" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260429/202604290539025238.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.8" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.8" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260429/202604290539025238_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260429/202604290539025238_720.jpg"> </div><p></p><p>巴黎5-4战胜拜仁，两队本场比赛只用了68分钟就一共打进9球，创欧冠半决赛进球纪录。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-04-29/69f11e035c078native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">怎能不爱！哈兰德观看巴黎5-4拜仁的比赛感叹：这就是足球</a></p><p style="text-align: center;"></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260429/202604290505378510_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260429/202604290505378510_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260429/202604290505378510_720.jpg"> </div><p></p><p>巴黎5-4战胜拜仁，打破欧冠半决赛单场进球纪录。曼城球星哈兰德观看了这场比赛的直播。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-04-29/69f1243ab026anative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">巴黎5-4拜仁！詹俊：史上最精彩欧冠，如同火云邪神大战六指琴魔</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.8" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260429/202604290521527375.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.8" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.8" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260429/202604290521527375.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260429/202604290521527375.jpg"> </div><p>巴黎5-4战胜拜仁，赛后，著名评述员詹俊老师对本场比赛发表评价。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-04-29/69f128977c065native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">埃贝尔：巴黎在5-2时庆祝仿佛已晋级决赛 现在次回合一切皆有可能</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/news/day_260429/202604290539202606.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/news/day_260429/202604290539202606.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/news/day_260429/202604290539202606.jpg"> </div><p>拜仁在本轮欧冠客场4-5不敌巴黎，总监埃贝尔在赛后接受了采访。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-04-29/69f12675c60b9native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">凯恩：点球判罚有些严厉；尽管有9个进球但我觉得防守还是不错的</a></p><p><strong>【其它热点新闻】</strong></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-04-29/69f0fe55c31aanative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">世界杯新规！官方：球员争执中捂嘴、擅自离场抗议均可被出示红牌</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.18" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260429/202604290237326439.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.18" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.18" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260429/202604290237326439_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260429/202604290237326439_720.jpg"> </div><p>IFAB官方宣布，世界杯将采取新规，球员冲突争执中捂嘴、抗议判罚离场可被直接出示红牌。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-04-29/69f0e3bbc8804native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">罗马诺：穆里尼奥愿重回皇马执教，相关谈判早已开始</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260108/695ed8a1b102a.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260108/695ed8a1b102a.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260108/695ed8a1b102a.jpg"> </div><p>罗马诺最新消息，穆里尼奥愿重回皇马执教。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-04-29/69f0fc809b277native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">记者：老佛爷已选择穆帅，克洛普虽更受欢迎但至少穆帅知根知底</a></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-04-29/69f0ffbf3c5cenative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">西媒：若巴萨确定提前夺冠，西足协希望国家德比赛后立刻颁奖</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260204/69827af76490f.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260204/69827af76490f.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260204/69827af76490f.jpg"> </div><p>加泰罗尼亚广播电台《Tot Costa》消息，若巴萨在第34轮或是第35轮的国家德比后确认夺冠，西足协将在国家德比赛后就为巴萨颁发冠军奖杯。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-04-28/69f0d15732607native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">曼晚：曼城对英超的赛程安排感到愤怒，提出5个解决方案均被否决</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.67" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_200711/5f089b562375d.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.67" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.67" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_200711/5f089b562375d.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_200711/5f089b562375d.jpg"> </div><p>据《曼彻斯特晚报》报道称，曼联对英超的赛程安排感到愤怒，提出5个赛程方案均被英超拒绝。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-04-29/69f0d93f30c77native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">外媒：莫德里奇左脸骨折已完成修复，其手机收到超200条各界信息</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260427/69ef698318af1.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260427/69ef698318af1.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260427/69ef698318af1.jpg"> </div><p>克罗地亚媒体报道，莫德里奇左脸颧骨的粉碎性骨折已经完成修复，医生对手术的进展感到非常满意。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-04-29/69f0dacfcc6e4native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">前队友！都体：洛卡特利向拉比奥特伸手示好遭拒，两人爆发口角</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_250924/68d391b7a8046.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_250924/68d391b7a8046.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_250924/68d391b7a8046.jpg"> </div><p>《都灵体育报》报道，米兰与尤文战平的这场焦点战中，虽然比分维持在0-0，但场下与场边的细节量不少。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-04-29/69f0de0b5a54fnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">标价高达1.3亿镑！天空：马竞不想卖阿尔瓦雷斯，阿森纳很有兴趣</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260123/69736a8140ef1.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260123/69736a8140ef1.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260123/69736a8140ef1.jpg"> </div><p>天空体育报道，马竞无意出售前锋阿尔瓦雷斯，如果离队球员标价高达1.3亿镑。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-04-29/69f0e32aadb4cnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">矿工高层：穆德里克若表现未达标我们会少3000万奖金，盼他快出战</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_241217/6760cbb3db99a.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_241217/6760cbb3db99a.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_241217/6760cbb3db99a.jpg"> </div><p>矿工CEO帕尔金接受采访，谈到穆德里克的兴奋剂调查及其对俱乐部产生的巨大财务影响。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-04-29/69f0f27812350native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">记者：戈登经纪人已和拜仁开启谈判，纽卡要8600万但拜仁不愿满足</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.37" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_230828/64ecc106f0e7d.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.37" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-wid